            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.gross" approved="yes"><source>Gross prices</source><target>Bruttopräisser</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxRate" approved="yes"><source>Tax rate in percent</source><target>Steiersaz a Prozent</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxRate.hint" approved="yes"><source>Basis for the gross display. 0 skips the conversion.</source><target>Basis fir d'Brutto-Uweisung. 0 iwwerspréngt d'Konvertéierung.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxSwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Visitors may switch between net and gross</source><target>Visiteure kënnen tëscht Netto a Brutto wiesselen</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxSwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>Unchecked, the page only shows the option selected above.</source><target>Wann net ugeklickt, weist d'Säit nëmmen déi uewen ausgewielt Optioun.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencySwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Currency switchable</source><target>Währung wiesselbar</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencySwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>The switch only appears if more than one currency is entered for the plans.</source><target>De Schalter erschéngt nëmmen, wa méi wéi eng Währung fir d'Pläng aginn ass.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.periodSwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Billing period switchable</source><target>Rechnungsperiod wiesselbar</target></trans-unit>
