            <trans-unit id="value.included.hint" approved="yes"><source>Applies to features of the type “Check or dash”.</source><target>Gëllt fir Fonctioune vum Typ „Check oder Bindestréch“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.value" approved="yes"><source>Value</source><target>Wäert</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.value.hint" approved="yes"><source>For number, text and percent. E.g. “unlimited”, “up to 48” or “2.1”.</source><target>Fir Zuelen, Text a Prozent. Z. B. „onlimitéiert“, „bis zu 48“ oder „2,1“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.sheet" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Präistabell</target></trans-unit>
