            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout" approved="yes"><source>Layout</source><target>Layout</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.hint" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards for a few plans, compact rows from about five, the comparison table for many features.</source><target>Plangkaarte fir e puer Pläng, kompakt Zeilen ab ongeféier fënnef, d'Vergläichstabell fir vill Fonctiounen.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.cards" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards</source><target>Plangkaarten</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.matrix" approved="yes"><source>Comparison table</source><target>Vergläichstabell</target></trans-unit>
