            <trans-unit id="flexform.showMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Also show comparison table</source><target>Och Vergläichstabell uweisen</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.showMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>The comparison table then appears below the chosen layout.</source><target>D'Vergläichstabell erschéngt dann ënner dem gewielte Layout.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.collapseMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Comparison table collapsed</source><target>Vergläichstabell zougeklappt</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.collapseMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>The comparison table only opens on click — keeps the page calm with many features.</source><target>D'Vergläichstabell geet nëmmen op Klick op — hält d'Säit bei ville Fonctiounen roueg.</target></trans-unit>
